Attribution / 致谢

- This is an independent diagnosis & mitigation tool for SpringBoard Mach port
  leaks on roothide-jailbroken iPhones. It attributes the leak to CallAssistant
  ("CallAssist", 电话助手/来电助手) polling IOKit power interfaces via XPC
  without releasing connections, and reclaims those leaked connections with a
  take-over / grace-period / reclaim strategy.

- BioProtect and CallAssistant are products of Limneos. This project contains
  NO code or binaries from either product; all findings are based on objective
  stack-backtrace observation. See reports/ for the full case file.

- 本项目为独立观测与诊断工具，未包含 BioProtect / CallAssistant 的任何代码或
  二进制；泄漏定责基于客观栈回溯数据，案卷见 reports/ 目录。
